<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14557" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁπτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅπτομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>able to come
				into contact with,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλήλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>GC</u>
					322b27
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἁ. αἴσθησιν</span> the sense <i>of
				touch,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>de An.</u>
				413b9
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
			</span></i><i>Pr.Praef.;</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἁ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>de An.</u>
					415a3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλῶττα ἁπτικωτάτη</span>”
				<i>most sensitive to touch,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>PA</u>
					660a21
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Olymp.
					<u>in Alc.</u>
					p.40C.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of medicines, <i>acting
				on,</i> c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ νευρώδους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					2.179
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
